{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24903","headline":"御制段太尉碑 · 薛存诚","name":"御制段太尉碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"葬仪从俭礼，刊石荷尧君。\n露迹垂繁字，天哀洒丽文。\n诏深荣嗣子，海变记孤坟。\n宝思皆涵象，皇心永念勳。\n雅词黄绢妙，渥泽紫泥分。\n青史应同久，芳名万古闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛存诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}